    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to a challenging colony simulation game set on a distant planet.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting with a small group of colonists, you're tasked to mine resources, refine materials, build structures, and innovate with new technologies. Across generations and centuries, you'll expand your settlement into a thriving civilization and terraform the planet to make it your new home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prosper Through the Ages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colonists are born, educated, work, retire, and die. Over generations, their needs may evolve and dedication may diminish.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/6ab0d39178f0668d47699f0657448e5b.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/6ab0d39178f0668d47699f0657448e5b.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/6ab0d39178f0668d47699f0657448e5b.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Principle of Mass Conservation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing simply disappears. Every bit of material transforms into something new. Resources follow their own cycles, involving production, consumption, and recycling.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/ac773d039f384295961858859d0d5d65.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/ac773d039f384295961858859d0d5d65.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/ac773d039f384295961858859d0d5d65.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Food</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform barren soil into fertile farmland using materials from your surroundings. Melt ice for water, use the water to grow food, and then purify it for reuse. Balance these elements and watch your colony thrive on the food you produce.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/9f2319672640f9a8f856c33a23650fe5.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/9f2319672640f9a8f856c33a23650fe5.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/9f2319672640f9a8f856c33a23650fe5.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convert exhaled carbon dioxide back into oxygen for your colonists. Tackle industrial pollution and manage various gases. As your base expands, maintaining atmospheric pressure becomes essential.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/5ea5f5f7913122f72d73ffbcfcf3e7ef.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/5ea5f5f7913122f72d73ffbcfcf3e7ef.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/5ea5f5f7913122f72d73ffbcfcf3e7ef.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Industry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin with mining ores and minerals, refine them into advanced materials essential for constructing buildings and crafting items. With each step, transform raw resources into the foundational elements of your expanding colony.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/034dd770404f8b9bcec2302005f3dd21.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/034dd770404f8b9bcec2302005f3dd21.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/034dd770404f8b9bcec2302005f3dd21.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Terraformation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform the planet's surface  to make it habitable by managing temperature control, ecosystem growth, and water resources. Create a breathable atmosphere and turn the planet into your new home. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2026 And More</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Research:</strong> Unlock new possibilities, buildings, and recipes via the research tree. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Power:</strong> Generate and store energy from diverse sources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Game Events:</strong> Strange things can happen in the cosmos. Some events might be nice, but some, well you will see for yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Space Management:</strong> Deal with the material you don't need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Luxury Food and Goods: </strong> Produce various items to keep colonists productive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Free time:</strong> Meet colonist social needs to prevent unrest. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Temperature:</strong> Control the temperature within your colony and on the planet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you underground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to a challenging colony simulation game set on a distant planet.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starting with a small group of colonists, you're tasked to mine resources, refine materials, build structures, and innovate with new technologies. Across generations and centuries, you'll expand your settlement into a thriving civilization and terraform the planet to make it your new home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prosper Through the Ages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colonists are born, educated, work, retire, and die. Over generations, their needs may evolve and dedication may diminish.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/6ab0d39178f0668d47699f0657448e5b.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/6ab0d39178f0668d47699f0657448e5b.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/6ab0d39178f0668d47699f0657448e5b.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Principle of Mass Conservation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing simply disappears. Every bit of material transforms into something new. Resources follow their own cycles, involving production, consumption, and recycling.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/ac773d039f384295961858859d0d5d65.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/ac773d039f384295961858859d0d5d65.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/ac773d039f384295961858859d0d5d65.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Food</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform barren soil into fertile farmland using materials from your surroundings. Melt ice for water, use the water to grow food, and then purify it for reuse. Balance these elements and watch your colony thrive on the food you produce.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/9f2319672640f9a8f856c33a23650fe5.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/9f2319672640f9a8f856c33a23650fe5.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/9f2319672640f9a8f856c33a23650fe5.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convert exhaled carbon dioxide back into oxygen for your colonists. Tackle industrial pollution and manage various gases. As your base expands, maintaining atmospheric pressure becomes essential.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/5ea5f5f7913122f72d73ffbcfcf3e7ef.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/5ea5f5f7913122f72d73ffbcfcf3e7ef.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/5ea5f5f7913122f72d73ffbcfcf3e7ef.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Industry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin with mining ores and minerals, refine them into advanced materials essential for constructing buildings and crafting items. With each step, transform raw resources into the foundational elements of your expanding colony.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/034dd770404f8b9bcec2302005f3dd21.poster.avif?t=1749070472\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/034dd770404f8b9bcec2302005f3dd21.webm?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2187340/extras/034dd770404f8b9bcec2302005f3dd21.mp4?t=1749070472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Terraformation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform the planet's surface  to make it habitable by managing temperature control, ecosystem growth, and water resources. Create a breathable atmosphere and turn the planet into your new home. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2026 And More</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Research:</strong> Unlock new possibilities, buildings, and recipes via the research tree. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Power:</strong> Generate and store energy from diverse sources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Game Events:</strong> Strange things can happen in the cosmos. Some events might be nice, but some, well you will see for yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Space Management:</strong> Deal with the material you don't need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Luxury Food and Goods: </strong> Produce various items to keep colonists productive. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Free time:</strong> Meet colonist social needs to prevent unrest. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Temperature:</strong> Control the temperature within your colony and on the planet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you underground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>",
